Whenever you get put in a scene with someone, that means you're going to work with them for about three or four hours that day exclusively.

85
00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:12.430
And whenever they're, you know, having their conversations about how the scene is going or in the breaks, you get to just chitty chat.

86
00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:13.710
