88
00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:17.790
But I just love, also, I just love working with Rain.

89
00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:19.150
I mean, you were so fortunate.

90
00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:20.690
You got to work with him all the time.

91
00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:21.350
All the time.

92
00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:21.930
All right.

