107
00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:04.170
Yeah.

108
00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:06.710
It does move forward Dwight and Angela a little bit.

109
00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:07.190
It does.

110
00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:07.990
I have that down.

111
00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:08.210
Yeah.

112
00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:13.370
It contains references to the Dwight-Angela love story, which was nice.

113
00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:15.410
It was.

114
00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:16.350
Which was nice.

115
00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:20.690
I mean, we'll get to it, but there are some moments in here that I just love.

116
00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:21.150
Yeah.

117
00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:22.110
With Dwight and Angela.

118
00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:22.610
I don't know.

119
00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:23.070
Me too.

120
