182
00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:37.010
He said, the conference room is so small.

183
00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:37.590
Yeah.

184
00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:39.170
He said, it's so small.

185
00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:41.550
And he goes, and there were so many of you.

186
00:06:42.010 --> 00:06:43.990
It's such a small room.

187
00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:46.850
And like him and Steve were at the front of the room.

188
00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:47.150
Yeah.

189
00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:49.270
So we're all looking at them, you know?

190
00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:49.550
Yeah.

191
00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:51.350
And he said, the room was so tiny.

192
00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.750
And he said, you guys had crammed so many people in there.

193
00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:55.610
And that actually really made me laugh.

194
00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:58.570
And then the one other thing he said he remembered from the set,

195
00:06:58.570 --> 00:07:00.670
A, he said we were all really nice.

196
00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:01.290
Oh, that's good.

197
00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:01.670
That's good.

198
00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:04.310
But he also said the food was awesome.

199
00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:04.670
Yeah.

200
00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:07.810
He said, you guys know you had really good food, right?

201
00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:08.450
We did.

202
00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:11.490
And I was like, yeah, that is true.

203
00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:13.410
My dad said the same thing after visiting.

204
00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:14.610
He was like, man, the food.

205
00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:15.950
We really did.

206
00:07:16.070 --> 00:07:16.950
We had really good food.

207
00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:19.510
Aw, that is so nice.

208
00:07:19.610 --> 00:07:19.990
Yes.

209
00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:21.370
It was a delight talking to him.

210
00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:23.590
And I have a few other things as the episode goes.

211
00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:24.590
Okay, I love that.

212
00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:25.350
I love that.

213
00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:26.130
All right.

