And then Pam goes over to Oscar and tells Oscar, hey, Oscar, I thought you'd like to know Dwight's going to be okay.

1498
00:55:47.480 --> 00:55:50.080
And it zooms in on your face.

1499
00:55:50.800 --> 00:55:52.180
And you're so relieved.

